{
  "slug": "greenflash",
  "name": "Greenflash",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Analyze real user-agent conversations to surface where users get blocked, optimize prompts, and understand what drives engagement or churn",
  "longDescription": "Ships **14 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (14): `greenflash` (Entry point for all Greenflash queries), `greenflash-diagnose` (Root cause analysis for silent failures your evals miss), `greenflash-health` (Surface quality trends, anomalies, safety issues, and sentiment across your AI products), `greenflash-inbox` (Triage flagged conversations prioritized by severity), `greenflash-onboard` (Low-level SDK install and conversation logging only), `greenflash-onboard-agentic` (Log structured message types for agentic workflows: tool calls, reasoning traces, and multi-step chains), `greenflash-onboard-events` (Track business events and link AI conversations to real outcomes like conversions, upgrades, and churn), `greenflash-onboard-prompts` (Log system prompts for automatic versioning and component-level optimization), and 6 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install greenflash@claude-community` from `greenflash-ai/agent-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
